20:["$","p",null,{"children":"Located at 20 Agadez Crescent, Wuse 2, our boutique hotel pairs the polish of a world-class property with the warmth only a family-run house can deliver. Four distinct room categories, a celebrated restaurant and bar, a professional conference hall and a glamorous swimming pool hall — all under one elegant roof."}]
